,"_185":202},"Play Pokemon Tactics","https://kekel87.itch.io/pokemon-tactics","Author-hosted browser demo on itch.io; choose Run game. Includes AI opponents and hot-seat play. An in-development fan project.","游戏平台","itch.io","指南形式","disclosure","tutorial","开发记录与教程",[210],{"_56":211,"_26":184,"_185":-7},"阅读作者的开发说明","研究这个工作流","ordered",true,[216,217,218,219],"Play a battle against the built-in opponents and test movement, height, type matchups and friendly fire.","Read the AI disclosure and CREDITS.md before exploring the engine and rendering packages.","Use Node 24 or later and pnpm 10.32.1 to run the complete workspace locally.","Change one tactical rule with an agent, then compare battle resolution, team setup and replay behavior.","AI 工作流与开发背景","作者负责设计与架构，Claude Code 与专门代理编写大部分代码、测试和文档。宝可梦数据、精灵图及部分 PixelLab 美术另有署名与使用条件，不能与代码许可混为一谈。","aiUse","创作方式","AI 辅助（创作者归属）","category","引擎","Babylon.js · TypeScript","ai-assisted",[216,217,218,219],{"_56":239,"_26":184,"_18":206},{"_56":200,"_26":201,"_18":196,"_185":202},{"_56":236,"_26":193,"_185":194,"_237":238},{"_56":235,"_26":184,"_185":186},[124],"Read the creator’s AI attribution","Open the complete game project","scope","complete-project","Read the creator’s development disclosure",{"_241":242},"documents",{"_65":243,"_36":244},[246,250,251,252,249,253,254,255,256,257,258,259,260,261,262,263,264,265,266,267,268,269,270,271,272,273,274,275,276,277,278,279,280,281,282,283,284,248,285,247,286,287,288,289,290,291,292,293,294,295,296,297,298,299,300,301,302,303],[245,246,247,248,249],"reading-guide","practical-guide","level-design-skill","deployment","publishing-platforms","tutorials-and-demos","coding-agent-game-code","game-testing-library","agents-notes","engines-notes","game-ai-notes","cadle-repositories","world-model-notes","research-index","production-research-notes","engine-operation-contracts","production-work-orders","studio-production-case-studies","native-operation-details","production-debugging-contracts","produc